(SplitTogether Fullstack Guide \(Beginner-Friendly\)) Tj
0 -16 Td
() Tj
0 -16 Td
(1\) What this app is) Tj
0 -16 Td
(SplitTogether is a web app where a frontend UI talks to backend API routes and a PostgreSQL) Tj
0 -16 Td
(database.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(Users can sign up, log in, create rooms, add expenses, and track balances.) Tj
0 -16 Td
() Tj
0 -16 Td
(2\) Stack used and why) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- Next.js 14 \(App Router\): one project for UI pages and backend API routes, simpler for MVP) Tj
0 -16 Td
(speed.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- TypeScript: catches mistakes earlier and makes refactors safer.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- React + Tailwind CSS: reusable UI components and fast styling.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- PostgreSQL: reliable relational database for connected data \(users, groups, expenses\).) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- Prisma ORM: type-safe DB queries and easy schema management.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- NextAuth \(credentials\): session/login handling integrated with Next.js.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- Zod validation: clear request validation and safer API inputs.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- Docker Compose: predictable local Postgres setup.) Tj
0 -16 Td
() Tj
0 -16 Td
(3\) How frontend and backend are linked in this app) Tj
0 -16 Td
(Flow: user action in UI -> fetch\(\) call -> /api route -> validation/auth checks -> Prisma DB) Tj
0 -16 Td
(query -> JSON response -> UI updates.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(Example \(create room\):) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- UI component submits room name from dashboard form.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- API route POST /api/groups validates input, checks session, creates Group + GroupMember +) Tj
0 -16 Td
(ActivityLog.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- UI gets returned room id and navigates to /groups/{id}.) Tj
0 -16 Td
() Tj
0 -16 Td
(4\) Key folders to know) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- web/app/: pages and API routes.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- web/components/: reusable UI pieces.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- web/lib/: shared logic \(session helpers, money helpers, balance math\).) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- web/prisma/schema.prisma: data model.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- web/prisma/seed.ts: demo seed data.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- web/middleware.ts: route protection.) Tj
0 -16 Td
() Tj
0 -16 Td
(5\) Authentication in simple terms) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- Signup endpoint stores password hash \(not plain text\).) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- Login checks password hash and creates session token.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- Protected pages \(dashboard/groups\) redirect to login if not authenticated.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(- API routes also check session server-side before writing data.) Tj
0 -16 Td
() Tj
0 -16 Td
(6\) Data model basics) Tj
0 -16 Td
(Core tables: User, Group, GroupMember, Expense, ExpenseShare, Settlement, ActivityLog.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(Important rule: money is stored as integer cents to avoid decimal rounding bugs.) Tj
0 -16 Td
